        "TileImage": "$($repository 5403294c-5390-46ba-a246-4bb6108253c0).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned five High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Carlisle Estate in Dartmoor, England. Below are the listed targets as well as the preferred methods for dealing with them;\r\rEliminate Phinas Whitmer with Fiber wire. \rEliminate Flynn Sharp with injected lethal poison. \rEliminate Leonard Parsons with a fall.\rEliminate Aron Ford Jr. by electrocution. \rEliminate Mr Fernsby via drowning. \r\rBe a ghost in the halls of the estate. Let no one see you our your victims. \r\rBest of luck!\rReapingZ",
